WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.734
-Good evening.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.002
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.304
We are back in the studio

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.939
and we hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.474
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:11.343
When asked last week by
reporters if he was confident

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:13.713
that he could get voting rights
legislation passed,

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.215
President Biden said, quote,

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:18.418
"I hope we can get this done,
but I'm not sure."

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.887
Wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.889
Quite a turn from
the "yes we can" days.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.026
It's like Nike changing
their slogan to,

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:30.797
"I dunno.
Go for it if you want."

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:31.630
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.099
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.900
volunteered
at a food bank yesterday

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.069
and wore
a Philadelphia Eagles T-shirt,

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:38.604
which was a nice way of showing

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:40.974
she understands pain
and hardship.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.475
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.979
Former President Donald Trump
held his first rally of the year

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.714
over the weekend in Arizona

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.016
and is already back
to telling lies.

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.450
-I love Arizona.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.186
-Come on.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.492
The CDC is reportedly
experiencing

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.095
a massive wave of staff burnout,

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:05.131
and even that was reported
two weeks late.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.899
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:08.568
Americans will be able to order

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.137
free at-home rapid
coronavirus tests

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.839
from the federal government
this week

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:17.310
and, in equally timely news,
2020 New Year's glasses.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.179
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:23.249
We like to get you the tests
after the wave.

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:27.286
Former President Trump has
reportedly been complaining

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:30.056
to confidants about
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.524
and said he has a, quote,
"dull personality."

00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:35.494
I'm sorry, that's suddenly
a concern of yours?

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:38.397
Your vice president
was like if a rice cake

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:39.999
went to Bible school.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.401
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:45.905
Republican Senator Mitt Romney
warned in a new interview

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.540
that Russian president
Vladimir Putin

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.708
is attempting to weaken
the NATO alliance

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.243
and re-create the Soviet Union.

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:53.980
Oh, thanks, Mitt.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.649
Mitt Romney is like a dad
who wanders in

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.651
while you're watching
Harry Potter and says,

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.120
"That Voldemort fella looks like
bad news to me."

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.057
"We know, Dad!

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.158
Get out!"

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.993
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.695
DIRECTV announced on Friday
that it will drop

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:12.297
the far-right television channel
One America News

00:02:12.297 --> 00:02:15.601
from its service once
its current contract expires,

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:18.271
or sooner
if it rains really hard.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.373
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:24.710
Yeah, thought that was going to
be a joke about OAN,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:26.312
but we went after DIRECTV.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.880
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.517
A Florida Republican who lost a
congressional special election

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:34.653
last week by 59 points
is refusing to concede the race.

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:37.256
But eventually he'll have to
go back to his old job

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:39.492
as Florida's
Math Teacher of the Year.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.261
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:46.866
Hopefully, people watching this
on DIRECTV

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.268
got some really hard rain
before that joke.

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:51.871
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.940
And finally,
according to a new study,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.443
playing a tape recording
of people's names while sleeping

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:59.545
can improve name recall
the next day.

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:03.282
So, shout-out to my writers Ian,
Brian, and turn tape over.

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:05.552
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:13.693
So, there was a new study about
an old-timey tape player?

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.060
I'm not so sure about that.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.563
That was the monologue,
everybody.

